WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.475
Trace: the map is real.

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:07.725
All of it: sixty-three thousand atoms, one hundred twenty trails.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:18.225
Ten million tokens pour in, crystallize into sixty-three thousand atoms, then merge to nine thousand leaves and three thousand seven hundred parents.

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:23.325
One atom: a real paper on cotton DNA. Then back out.

00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:28.625
Probe seven: guided four of ten, flat nothing on the same budget.

00:00:29.525 --> 00:00:35.125
All one hundred twenty. Zero point seven three. Sixteen below half, held red.

00:00:36.925 --> 00:00:42.950
Flat is no straw man: same budget, zero point seven three versus zero point zero six.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:48.575
Ten million: one tile, proven. A hundred million: drawn, not built.

00:00:49.475 --> 00:00:54.225
This map is real. Open it.  Replay any probe.
